H("615.d.8.B",3,"A new parent takes on caregiving duties, while a grandparent may become a source of advice. This shows how roles and responsibilities change throughout the:","life cycle",["menu","budget","week"],"Roles change by stage.")
H("615.d.8.B",4,"During the child-rearing stage, parents' main responsibilities are to provide for children's needs and:","guide their growth",["avoid children","retire","travel"],"Parents nurture and teach.")
H("615.d.8.C",3,"Having a first child adds expenses such as child care and health costs. This is a financial consideration of the family life:","cycle",["tax","menu","trend"],"Costs change with each stage.")
